      <technology>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Technology: The basic materials are poured by gravity in a mixer. When filled with 1"500kg the mixing procedure starts and lasts about 15min. To keep it warm it"s filled in a hot basin from where it is put in sausages by a cartridging machine and then packed in card board boxes. A conveyor belt transports the boxes and puts it on paletts for storing</text>
        </comment>
      </technology>
